incoln-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows June to July and July to August each came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids. In 2025, June to July landed at 19% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, May to June sits at 33% of normal there. Every grid had its driest year in 2013, with grid 27662 at 43%.</p>"}
